OL,3,GNEWSAMet Office could name storm after
OL,4,AShaun the Sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FShaun the Sheep could be facing a
OL,7,Fstormy day out with his cousin Timmy
OL,8,Fthe Lamb, as the Met Office looks to
OL,9,Fname a storm after one of them.
OL,11,FThe forecaster is putting Shaun and
OL,12,FTimmy head to head in a social media
OL,13,Fvote, with one set to become a storm
OL,14,Fname for the September 2026 to August
OL,15,F2027 season.
OL,17,FBut the cousins would have to get
OL,18,Fthrough some particularly wild and
OL,19,Fwindy adventures before getting their
OL,20,Fstar moment, as the Met Office has only
OL,21,Fever made it to 'L' in its list - with
OL,22,FStorm Lilian in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
