OL,3,GNEWSAMet Office could name storm after
OL,4,AShaun the Sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy Pearson from Bristol-based Aardman
OL,7,Fsaid: "Whoever you're backing, we hope
OL,8,Fthe vote sparks some fun conversations
OL,9,Fabout severe weather and how it can
OL,10,Faffect all of us."
